    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Optimization Target Type Descriptions",
      "Anchor": "optimization-target-type-descriptions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Objective Type Descriptions",
        "Optimization Target Type Descriptions"
      ],
      "Text": "OptimizationTargetType is used to optimize spending for a campaign. Depending on what value is populated in this field, the campaign will use either auto or manual bidding.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Optimization Target Type Descriptions",
      "Anchor": "optimization-target-type-descriptions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Objective Type Descriptions",
        "Optimization Target Type Descriptions"
      ],
      "Text": "For auto-bidding campaigns created using legacy Objectives, the costType is always CPM. The unitCost defaults to 0. Note that there are no validations and can be set to any arbitrary high/low value.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Optimization Target Type Descriptions",
      "Anchor": "optimization-target-type-descriptions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Objective Type Descriptions",
        "Optimization Target Type Descriptions"
      ],
      "Text": "If optimizationTargetType is switched to a manual-bidding type, unitCost should be set to a value appropriate to the dailyBudget. Failure to set the unitCost correctly can lead to unexpected expenses. We highly recommend updating both unitCost and optimizationTargetType when switching.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Optimization Target Type Descriptions",
      "Anchor": "optimization-target-type-descriptions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Objective Type Descriptions",
        "Optimization Target Type Descriptions"
      ],
      "Text": "If you want to optimize the campaign for spending, you must set the OptimizationTargetType to one of the following target types.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Optimization Target Type Descriptions",
      "Anchor": "optimization-target-type-descriptions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Objective Type Descriptions",
        "Optimization Target Type Descriptions"
      ],
      "Text": "Setting the optimizationTargetType as any of the following keeps a campaign in manual-bidding mode:",
